,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴仲圭墨竹","author":"袁华","text":"风生太液水微波，霜影侵阶月色多。\n截得昭华苍玉琯，多情箫史奈愁何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21966,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"狸奴窥蝶图","author":"袁华","text":"黑睛如线午风清，贾勇潜身势不惊。\n莫向花阴窥蛱蝶，街头鼠辈政从衡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21967,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过清江浦","author":"袁华","text":"八里庄头淮水长，清江浦边杨柳黄。\n楚女窄靴小锦袖，醉歌竹枝行玉觞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21968,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过能拙翁兰若","author":"袁华","text":"盐铁塘边草色齐，我居塘东子塘西。\n兴来相过不相问，自把新诗竹上题。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21969,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二月廿九日游董氏坟庵次钱成夫韵","author":"袁华","text":"明朝二月三十日，三分己过二分春。\n莫思万事且饮酒，林外提壶亦劝人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21970,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"草堂清集 其一","author":"袁华","text":"芙蓉小苑落秋红，声动帷犀瑟瑟风。\n共说扬州月无赖，紫鸾箫里露台空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21971,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d